 "key_findings": [
 "Fidaxomicin has both anti-vegetative cell and anti-spore effects, leading to lower recurrence rates (15.4% vs25.3% for vancomycin) in clinical trials.",
 "Vancomycin lacks inhibitory effect on C. difficile spore germination, but vancomycin-loaded nanoparticles can delay spore germination.",
